<span id="cb10-17">--console pty,target_type=serial <span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">\</span></span>
<span id="cb10-18">--noautoconsole</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>In this example, 4GB of RAM and 2 vCPUs are allocated to the virtual machine.</p>
<p>After creation, if you would like to remove the virtual machine, you can use the <code>virsh undefine</code> command:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb11" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb11-1"><span class="ex" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">virsh</span> undefine <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span><span class="va" style="color: #111111;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">$VM_NAME</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span> <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">--remove-all-storage</span> <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">--nvram</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>To do this, you need to make sure that the virtual machine is shut down first</p>
</section>
<section id="daily-operation" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="daily-operation">Daily operation</h2>
<p>To show the console of the virtual machine, we can use the <code>virsh console</code> command:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb12" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb12-1"><span class="ex" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">virsh</span> console <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span><span class="va" style="color: #111111;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">$VM_NAME</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>To shut down the virtual machine, we can use the <code>virsh shutdown</code> command:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb13" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb13-1"><span class="ex" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">virsh</span> shutdown <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span><span class="va" style="color: #111111;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">$VM_NAME</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
